but then it turned out to be a bouton
or next year's Lady Rose,

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.360
so I thought it was my chance...

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:35.490
Noriko.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.810
I am sorry.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.900
Me, too.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:44.130
Shimako, are you uncertain who will
be the Rosa Gigantea after you?

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.480
No, I have faith that Noriko will do a
splendid job becoming my successor.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:52.910
Then let your little sister see you at work.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:57.660
For that will lead to how Noriko-chan
goes about her job next year.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:59.160
I understand.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.290
Onee-sama...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.230
It's fine.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.560
I'll go make a fresh pot of tea.

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:12.240
Mami-san, if we're doing
this event again this year,

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:14.440
you're planning on doing it
again next year, aren't you?

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:16.010
Of course! It's a popular event!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.280
What blissfully happy people they are...
Of course! It's a popular event!

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.300
What blissfully happy people they are...

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.440
It must be nice to be Shimako-san.

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:24.720
Not only does she not have to say
good-bye to her big sister,

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.620
but she already has a little sister, too.

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:27.790
Yeah.

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:28.760
Say...

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:34.390
Aren't you mad that our dear sisters
agreed to this without asking us?

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:36.560
That part, yes, a little.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.190
Only a little?

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.520
Yeah...

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.370
There are problems,

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.410
but just like my dear sister said,

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.100
I don't think there's any reason to refuse.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.440
Last year, Mizuno Yoko-sama's dream came true.

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:01.960
To make the Rose Mansion...

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.790
...a place where normal students
come and go ceaselessly.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:09.890
I want to see that same dream again.

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:19.240
Nana-chan will be entering
our school, you know.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:20.640
Yeah.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:27.300
Yoshino-san?

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.650
You spilled some tea leaves.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:43.260
You know, Yumi-san, you're so calm. Why?

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.160
How do you mean?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.760
I don't really know, but you've been calm lately.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.670
If you don't really know, then I can't know.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:54.270
Nevermind me.

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:56.040
What do you plan to do about Toko-chan?

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.370
It's easy for you to ask
what I'm going to do, but...

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.980
There's really nothing I can do.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:03.710
You're not going to make her your soeur?

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:07.350
I mean, she'd have to say yes for that to work.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:08.550
True, but...

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:12.380
If I appear to be calm, then that...

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.650
...might be because I've stopped fretting.

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:18.160
Stopped fretting?

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:19.160
Yeah.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:24.370
Like "I have to find a little sister
before my big sister graduates."

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:28.510
Or "I want to make Toko-chan my little
sister, if it's the last thing I do."

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:32.280
That kind of fretfulness has sort
of gone away, strangely...

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.140
Is there something that made that happen?

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:37.320
I don't know if I could say
that it made it happen,

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.150
but if I had to say, I guess it was the election.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.710
The election?

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:44.460
Yeah, ever since then, I've been thinking...

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:48.160
...about what kind of relationship
I want with Toko-chan.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.150
Really putting my mind to it.

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:56.470
This is one thing where fretting about
it won't yield an answer, right?

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:03.140
Yumi-san, don't grow up all by yourself!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.700
What? I haven't. Not at all.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.080
Don't leave me behind!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.280
What are you so worried about?

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:10.940
You're so funny, Yoshino-san.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:11.720
And it turned into a game of tag,
chasing Yumi-san.
You're so funny, Yoshino-san.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.850
And it turned into a game of tag,
chasing Yumi-san.
But I mean!

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.680
And it turned into a game of tag,
chasing Yumi-san.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:17.830
The Lillian Ledger with a
detailed account of that event...

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.820
...was incredibly well received.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.330
According to rumors, it not only made
the rounds in our high school,

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.800
but also got around quite a bit
in the middle school, too!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.330
I know! I just had a great idea!
but also got around quite a bit
in the middle school, too!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:25.900
I know! I just had a great idea!

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.030
But it might be a bit difficult.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.340
If it actually happens, I'm sure you'll also...

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:30.600
What is it?

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:31.510
No, there's no harm in trying!
What is it?

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.270
No, there's no harm in trying!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:33.900
Hey, Mami-san!

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.630
How about this year, we allow middle
school students to participate, too?

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:38.780
Wait, Yumi-san!

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:41.610
Some of them snuck over here
to watch last year, right?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:45.950
What? Yes, you're right,
I've heard stories like that.

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:51.760
All right. I'll try asking the teachers.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.120
Thank you, Mami-san.

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.720
Oh, Yumi-san.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:02.360
And I told you not to leave me behind.

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:05.870
Yoshino-san.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.570
Oh, Mami-san.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:10.280
Actually, this is about the idea...

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.510
...of letting middle school
students participate in the event...

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:16.220
Well, the ultimate conclusion is that
we managed to compromise...

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:18.740
...and got the teachers to agree to it.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:19.980
Compromise?

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:23.490
They'll be allowed to submit only to
the pool of absentee participants.

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:24.420
I see.

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:28.350
So, that's basically it,
but what will you do, Yoshino-san?

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.560
Will you go tell Nana-chan now?

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:34.570
I don't think I will right now.

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:35.430
Oh?

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:38.070
I think there's no reason for me to fret.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:41.280
Besides, we may all seem different,

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.570
but we might be fundamentally
more similar than we'd expect.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:45.600
Who's "we"?

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:47.040
Soeurs.

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.080
Shimako-san!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:51.990
Are you going to the Rose Mansion now?

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:52.750
Yes.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.450
Hold on a second.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.030
Thank you for your hard work.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.240
Oh...

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.310
Good day.

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:20.400
Good day.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.450
You're always so diligent.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:29.110
Right now, Yumi-sama and I are alone here.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.520
So...

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:34.430
You know, there's something
I want to talk to you about a bit.

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:35.120
What?

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.330
I mean, naturally,

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:41.630
we can talk about it once Shimako-san
and Yoshino-san get here, too.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.140
Oh, that was what you meant.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.030
What's wrong?

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.170
Nothing. Pardon me.

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:52.400
What? Did you think it was about Toko-chan?

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:53.640
Yes...

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:56.920
There haven't been any real developments,

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:59.280
so I don't have anything particular to report.

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:00.250
Right...

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:03.710
But if there's something you
want to ask me, go ahead.

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:07.960
Though, I may not be able to give
you a satisfactory answer.

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:11.160
Something I want to ask...

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:14.800
What is there that I want to
ask Yumi-sama right now?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:21.010
Why is she leaving Toko alone?

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:23.840
Can I believe what she said
about not giving up on Toko?

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:28.140
What does she think about the fact
that Toko lost the election?

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:33.850
Does she ever intend to offer
Toko her rosary again?

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.590
About Toko...

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.020
Are you fond of her?

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:54.740
I am fond of her.

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:56.110
Very fond.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.270
Then, that is fine.

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:06.620
With regards to Yumi-san's
suggestion the other day...

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:11.190
...to allow middle school students
to also participate in the event...

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:12.360
There were actually...

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:15.160
...a number of students who
jumped the gun last year,

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:17.660
which the middle school teachers
were also aware of...

00:22:17.660 --> 00:22:19.930
...and they were apparently looking
at ways to check that this year.

00:22:19.930 --> 00:22:21.340
Yumi-sama is fond of Toko.
...and they were apparently looking
at ways to check that this year.

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:22.390
Yumi-sama is fond of Toko.

00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:29.240
That was the one thing that
I wanted to hear most from her.

